# Fireworks's plan usage, in its usage panel.

## Setup: how to find each value the provider reads. Setting names,
## environment variables, URLs, cookie and header names, and the
## service's own menu paths stay as written.

usage-fireworks-setting-api-key = 从 https://app.fireworks.ai/settings/users/api-keys 获取的 Fireworks API 密钥。用于读取账号的计费摘要。
usage-fireworks-setting-account-slug = Fireworks 账号 ID，仅当 API 密钥可访问多个账号时需要。可在 https://app.fireworks.ai 的账号切换器中或通过 `firectl whoami` 查找。

## The report: API spend over the last 30 days, and the account it was read
## for. The account slug stays as Fireworks names it.

usage-fireworks-spend = 过去 30 天花费
usage-fireworks-rated-spend = 按费率计算的花费
# The rated spend of an account with no rated line items.
usage-fireworks-none = 无
usage-fireworks-account = 账号
# The account's short name in Fireworks URLs, such as acme.
usage-fireworks-slug = Slug
